WEBVTT

00:09:59.775 --> 00:10:02.637
We have to be prepared to work with an AI

00:10:02.661 --> 00:10:05.599
that's the one that we actually have
in the present day.

00:10:05.623 --> 00:10:09.828
And present-day AI is plenty weird enough.

00:10:09.852 --> 00:10:11.042
Thank you.

00:10:11.066 --> 00:10:16.291
(Applause)